  /// Builds a versioned agent pack (zip + manifest + sha256) — dm.ai #595.
  ///
  /// Mirrors the Java `CompileCommand`: parses `entry.json` plus
  /// `--agent-root` / `--version` / `--versions-file` / `--out` /
